{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123755","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123755/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123755/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123755/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123755","id":5552984368,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSvvRMA","number":123755,"title":"Changing your Windows Theme from dark to light doesn't properly change the godot theme for the 2d toolbar","user":{"login":"abz-code","id":239765757,"node_id":"U_kgDODkqI_Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/239765757?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code","html_url":"https://github.com/abz-code","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abz-code/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-23T11:53:06Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T12:21:46Z","closed_at":"2026-09-23T12:21:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot v4.8.dev6, v4.7.2 stable and master [4e244f2] currently \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev6 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (3840x2160 @ 143.99 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1692) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700KF (28 threads) - 31.79 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nChanging your Windows Theme from dark to light doesn't properly change the godot theme for the 2d toolbar unless you restart the game engine, \n\n\n2d toolbar normally looks like this in light mode:\n\n<img width=\"944\" height=\"86\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ded2fa6c-549d-4494-bf37-ec5aaa624fc6\" />\n\n2d toolbar normally looks like this in dark mode:\n\n<img width=\"602\" height=\"54\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8438e5f8-4ff4-4d10-bfa0-409ca7205627\" />\n\nChanging from light to dark in windows whilst godot is running results in the 2d toolbar that looks like this\n\n<img width=\"953\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27cc2c6d-338b-483d-ac55-0e5f91aab316\" />\n\nChanging from dark to light in windows whilst godot is running results in the 2d toolbar that looks like this with\n\n<img width=\"509\" height=\"68\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b01c87a6-c544-4924-8d41-091ef74f245d\" />\n\n\nbut this change doesn't happen for the 3d toolbar that accurately changes to the correct theme at runtime\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\ncreate a new project\nopen project\ngo to windows theme changer\n<img width=\"347\" height=\"247\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52b3930d-88c9-4cbf-b458-1d1a37891f43\" /> \nchange to light mode from dark\nobserve inconsistent changes in 2d toolbar and consistent changes in 3d toolbar\n\n\nif you restart the game engine it will accurately display the theme but not whilst the windows theme is changed during runtime\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123755/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123755/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}